# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Emir Bilgili et al. (2026). Machine-learned interatomic potential for predictive simulation of Mo S 2 epitaxy.
#   Physical Review Materials. doi:10.1103/71xp-pjb6  arXiv:2512.15952v3
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2512.15952v3 (sha256 706bb1a6e893f543...);
