# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/bilgili2026.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the selected UF3 potential for the Mo-S system (2- and
# 3-body B-spline potential fitted with UF3Tools), its test-set energy
# and force errors, and the CPU timing comparison against MACE-MP-0 and
# CHGNet on a 6,000-atom supercell. Structural, elastic, phonon, defect,
# edge and epitaxy results are property comparisons.

